cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in research, cite it using this metadata."
title: WARM
authors:
  - name: WritersLogic Contributors
version: 0.6.4
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: https://github.com/writerslogic/warm
url: https://writerslogic.com/warm
abstract: >-
  WARM is a local Rust library for hybrid document and vector
  search, graph indexing, agent memory and vector-symbolic operations. It
  provides persistent stores, Node.js and native Python bindings, a C ABI,
  an HTTP server and an MCP server. Runtime capabilities and experimental
  features are documented separately.
